{
  "header": "<a class=\"logo\" href=\"#overview\" aria-label=\"XSCENE home\"><img src=\"assets/images/xscene-mark.svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" alt=\"\">XSCENE<span>.</span></a><nav class=\"desktop-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><details class=\"feature-menu\"><summary>Features <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"feature-dropdown\"><a href=\"#feature-assets\">Reusable asset libraries</a><a href=\"#feature-prompts\">Structured prompts</a><a href=\"#workflow\">Connected creative workflow</a></div></details><a href=\"#workflow\">How it works</a><a href=\"#template-examples\">Templates</a><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a class=\"header-login\" href=\"#login\">Log in</a><a class=\"button primary header-start\" href=\"#login\">Start free <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div><details class=\"mobile-nav\"><summary aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16 M4 12h16 M4 18h16\"/></svg></summary><nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"#feature-assets\">Features</a><a href=\"#workflow\">How it works</a><a href=\"#template-examples\">Templates</a><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a><a href=\"#login\">Log in / Start free</a></nav></details>",
  "overview": "\n<div class=\"hero-layout\"><div class=\"hero-message\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span> AI VIDEO PRODUCTION WORKSPACE</div><h1 id=\"overview-title\">AI video,<br>made easier.<br><span>Save credits.<br>Stay consistent.</span></h1><p class=\"hero-copy\">Turn your idea into a ready-to-use AI video prompt. Bring your own assets, plan consistent scenes, and create with your favorite video tools.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"#login\">Start your next scene <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"#workflow\"><span class=\"play-outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> See how it works</a></div><div class=\"hero-benefits\"><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m13 2-9 12h7l-1 8 10-12h-7z\"/></svg><span><b>Move faster</b><small>From idea to a<br>ready-to-use prompt</small></span></div><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 5c0 2-4 3-9 3S3 7 3 5s4-3 9-3 9 1 9 3ZM3 5v14c0 2 4 3 9 3s9-1 9-3V5 M3 12c0 2 4 3 9 3s9-1 9-3\"/></svg><span><b>Save your credits</b><small>Plan the details<br>before generating</small></span></div><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9 M17 3l-5 9 9-5 M16 12a4 4 0 1 1-4-4\"/></svg><span><b>Stay consistent</b><small>Reuse your assets<br>across every scene</small></span></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-visual\"><div class=\"visual-ring\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"production-flow\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Illustrative workflow: upload references, generate a prompt, copy it into an AI video tool, then review the output\"><div class=\"asset-stack\" id=\"feature-assets\"><div class=\"demo-asset\"><span class=\"demo-photo photo-cell-0 \" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Character reference example\"></span><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0ZM4 21v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2\"/></svg><b>Upload <br>Character</b><small>Face & outfit</small></div><span class=\"demo-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"demo-asset\"><span class=\"demo-photo photo-cell-2 \" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Product reference example\"></span><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 4z M3 7v10l9 4 9-4V7 M12 11v10\"/></svg><b>Upload <br>Product</b><small>Shape & details</small></div><span class=\"demo-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"demo-asset\"><span class=\"demo-brand\" aria-label=\"Example brand: LUMI\">LUMI<span>EAU DE PARFUM</span></span><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h7l10 10-7 7L4 11z M8 8h.01\"/></svg><b>Upload <br>Brand</b><small>Logo, colors & style</small></div><span class=\"demo-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"demo-asset\"><span class=\"demo-photo photo-cell-14 \" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Background reference example\"></span><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v18H3z M3 16l5-5 4 4 3-3 6 6 M16 7h.01\"/></svg><b>Upload <br>Background</b><small>Location & atmosphere</small></div><span class=\"demo-tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"flow-junction\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M0 56C38 56 10 230 48 230M0 172C30 172 20 230 48 230M0 288C30 288 20 230 48 230M0 404C38 404 10 230 48 230\"/><path d=\"m38 220 10 10-10 10\"/></svg></div><div class=\"prompt-stage\" id=\"feature-prompts\"><span class=\"stage-symbol\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 20 12-12 4 4L8 24z M18 2v5 M15.5 4.5h5 M7 3v6 M4 6h6 M20 16v6 M17 19h6\"/></svg></span><h2>Generated<br>prompt</h2><div class=\"prompt-list\"><div><span class=\"demo-tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span>Master Prompt</div><div><span class=\"demo-tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span>Shot by Shot</div><div><span class=\"demo-tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span>Short Prompt</div><div><span class=\"demo-tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></span>Negative Prompt</div></div></div><span class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"tool-stage\"><span class=\"stage-symbol small-symbol\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 8h13v13H8z M16 8V3H3v13h5\"/></svg></span><h2>Copy to your<br>video AI tool</h2><div class=\"tool-name\"><span class=\"tool-letter veo\">V</span>Veo</div><div class=\"tool-name\"><span class=\"tool-letter kling\">K</span>Kling</div><div class=\"tool-name\"><span class=\"tool-letter seedance\">S</span>Seedance</div><div class=\"tool-name\"><span class=\"tool-letter sora\">S</span>Sora</div><span class=\"more-tools\">+ Other models</span></div><span class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"output-stage\"><div class=\"output-picture\"><span class=\"demo-photo photo-cell-0 \" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative character frame in a warm café\"></span><span class=\"demo-photo photo-ce