  "pricing": "<div class=\"pricing-intro\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">SPACE TO EXPLORE</div><h2 id=\"pricing-title\">Your next chapter.<br>Free to begin.</h2><p>Build your workflow, explore your ideas and find your creative rhythm.</p></div><div class=\"price-card\"><div class=\"price-heading\"><span>EARLY ACCESS</span><span class=\"price-badge\">FREE THROUGH FEBRUARY 2027</span></div><div class=\"price\">Free<span>until February 28, 2027</span></div><ul><li>Structured AI video prompts</li><li>Reusable reference asset libraries</li><li>Scene planning and prompt history</li></ul><p class=\"paid-note\">Paid access begins March 1, 2027. Pricing will be announced before the free period ends.</p><a class=\"button light\" href=\"#login\">Get started <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><small>Third-party video generation credits are separate.</small></div>"
